# CRUD Blueprint Rules

- Use App Router and TypeScript strict mode.
- Generate Prisma model, Zod schema, DTOs, services, API routes, hooks, forms and tables together.
- All mutations require authentication, brand isolation, outlet isolation when applicable, AuditLog entries, and checkMenuPolicy() permission checks.
- Forms use React Hook Form + Zod.
- Prefer transactions for multi-table writes.
- No placeholders or TODOs.
